If the build hit the spinlock error again (re-clone), just re-run the `grep…sed` patch line then `./build.sh …` once more. When it's green:

```bash
sudo chmod 666 /dev/ttyACM0
cd ~/openvela/nuttx
esptool --chip esp32s3 --port /dev/ttyACM0 write_flash 0x0 nuttx.bin
sudo picocom -b 115200 /dev/ttyACM0
```
Then at the prompt, run the framebuffer test:
```
nsh> fb
```

