esp_nn_conv_filter_pack

esp_nn_pack_conv_weights

Step 2 – Use it in Prepare
If found, modify Prepare to always request the filter buffer for kTfLiteInt8 (not just kTfLiteInt4):

c
// In Prepare, after calculating filter_size, do this for int8 too:
if (input->type == kTfLiteInt8) {
    int filter_size = ...; // same as the int4 calculation
    context->RequestScratchBufferInArena(context, filter_size,
